    "Commit and description cite the exact assertion failure in AddChainstate: `Assertion failed: (!prev_chainstate.m_mempool || prev_chainstate.m_mempool->size() == 0), function AddChainstate, file validation.cpp, line 6201`.",
    "Functional test in feature_assumeutxo.py reproduces the race using a FIFO and confirms the node aborts on master when a transaction is submitted during the load."
  ],
